WEBVTT

00:17:29.163 --> 00:17:31.142
I know you've all been there.

00:17:31.166 --> 00:17:33.115
I'm in the crucible right now.

00:17:33.139 --> 00:17:34.979
It's my trial by fire.

00:17:35.003 --> 00:17:37.309
It's my company's trials by fire.

00:17:37.333 --> 00:17:41.566
We survive because our theme
song is "Rise Above."

00:17:41.590 --> 00:17:44.707
Boy falls from the sky, rise above.

00:17:44.731 --> 00:17:47.121
It's right there in the palm
of both of our hands,

00:17:47.145 --> 00:17:48.748
of all of my company's hands.

00:17:48.772 --> 00:17:52.316
I have beautiful collaborators,
and we as creators

00:17:52.340 --> 00:17:54.327
only get there all together.

00:17:54.351 --> 00:17:56.516
I know you understand that.

00:17:56.540 --> 00:17:58.941
And you just stay going forward,

00:17:58.965 --> 00:18:01.582
and then you see this extraordinary thing